AFC duwé 46 nagara anggota sing akeh-akeh dumunung ing Asia. Nagara sing duwé wewengkon ing Éropa lan Asia, kaya &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kazakhstan"&gt;Kazakhstan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Azerbaijan"&gt;Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Georgia"&gt;Georgia&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu sajeroning &lt;a href="UEFA"&gt;UEFA&lt;/a&gt;. 
AFC diadegaké &lt;a href="8%20M%C3%A8i"&gt;8 Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1954"&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Manila"&gt;Manila&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt; lan minangka salah siji saka enem konfederasi bawana &lt;a href="F%C3%A9d%C3%A9ration%20Internationale%20de%20Football%20Association"&gt;FIFA&lt;/a&gt;. FIFA ngakoni AFC wiwit &lt;a href="21%20Juni"&gt;21 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1954"&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt;. Markas AFC dumunung ing AFC House, Dalan 1/155, Bukit Jalil, &lt;a href="Kuala%20Lumpur"&gt;Kuala Lumpur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;. Presidhèné ya iku &lt;a href="Mohammed%20bin%20Hammam"&gt;Mohammed bin Hammam&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Qatar"&gt;Qatar&lt;/a&gt;).
