<ol>
<li>&lt;a href="Kolosus%20ing%20Rodos"&gt;Kolosus ing Rodos&lt;/a&gt; - reca &lt;a href="Helios"&gt;Helios&lt;/a&gt; sing gedhé banget, digawé watara taun &lt;a href="292%20SM"&gt;292&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="280%20SM"&gt;280 SM&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Chures"&gt;Chures&lt;/a&gt;, saiki &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
