<li>&lt;a href="Mausoleum%20Mausolus"&gt;Mausoleum Mausolus&lt;/a&gt; - makam &lt;a href="Mausolus"&gt;Mausolus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="satrap"&gt;satrap&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Iran"&gt;Pèrsi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Caria"&gt;Caria&lt;/a&gt;, digawé pada taun &lt;a href="353%20SM"&gt;353&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="351%20SM"&gt;351 SM&lt;/a&gt;, ing kutha &lt;a href="Halicarnassus"&gt;Halicarnassus&lt;/a&gt;, saiki &lt;a href="Bodrum"&gt;Bodrum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
