<doc id="74174" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=74174" title="Bob Marley">
Bob Marley

Robert Nesta Marley, utawi dipuntepang ugi Bob Marley (#ALIH).
&lt;a href="Penyanyi"&gt;Penyanyi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="musisi"&gt;musisi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="reggae"&gt;reggae&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="penulis%20lagu"&gt;penulis lagu&lt;/a&gt;. Ramané asmané (&lt;a href="Norval%20Marley"&gt;Kapten Norval Marley&lt;/a&gt;) nikah karo kenya ayu jenengé &lt;a href="Cedalla"&gt;Cedalla Jamaika Booker&lt;/a&gt;.
Marley ngrewangi ngenalaké musik reggae ana ing donya lan tetep dadi salah sijining seniman kang paling disenengi tekan dina iki.
Bob Marley ngawiti kariré karo grup band the Wailers, grup the &lt;a href="The%20Wailers"&gt;Wailers&lt;/a&gt; kang di wujud karo &lt;a href="Peter%20Tosh"&gt;musisi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bunny%20Livingston"&gt;musisi&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1963.
Marley resmi nikah karo &lt;a href="Rita"&gt;Rita Marley&lt;/a&gt; ing wulan February 1966. Lan Rita kang ngenalaké Robert Nesta Marley karo &lt;a href="Rastafarianism"&gt;Rastafarianism&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun 1969, Marley, &lt;a href="Tosh"&gt;Tosh&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Livingston"&gt;Livingston&lt;/a&gt; kanthi penuh nguasani Rastafarianism, kang akèh banget ngaruhi musiké (&lt;a href="Rastafarianism"&gt;Rastafarianism&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="reggae"&gt;reggae&lt;/a&gt; racaké.
<h2>Karir Musik</h2>
Karir Musik.
Panjenenganipun wiwit misuwur ing donya &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="reggae"&gt;reggae&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1962. Album pertamané ya iku "&lt;a href="The%20Wailing%20Wailers"&gt;The Wailing Wailers&lt;/a&gt;" kang dirilis taun 1965 karo &lt;a href="The%20Wailers"&gt;The Wailers&lt;/a&gt;, ing 1974 lagu "&lt;a href="No%20Woman%20No%20Cry"&gt;No Woman No Cry&lt;/a&gt;" dadi populer ing &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt; lan nagara-nagara &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, tanapi ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt; piyambaké mengidap lelara &lt;a href="kanker"&gt;kanker&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing taun &lt;a href="1981"&gt;1981&lt;/a&gt; Marley ninggal dunya amarga &lt;a href="kanker"&gt;kangker kulit&lt;/a&gt; kang dialami kurang luwih patang taun kapungkur. piyambaké ninggal garwa lan 13 putra.
